            <a href={s.link} class="inline-block text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all hover:scale-105" style="background: rgba(201,168,76,0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.3); color: #c9a84c;">
              View Product →
